---
import Site from '../layouts/Site.astro'

const lastUpdated = '24 May 2026'
---

<Site
  title="Privacy Policy"
  description="How SEQ Campers collects, uses, and protects your personal information when you enquire about a caravan or use this website."
>
  <div class="page-header">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="page-eyebrow">Legal</div>
      <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p>Last updated: {lastUpdated}</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container" style="max-width:760px;">
      <div class="rich-text">
        <p>
          This is a placeholder privacy policy. SEQ Campers will update this
          page with the formal policy text. The summary below reflects how
          we currently handle information.
        </p>

        <h2>What we collect</h2>
        <p>
          When you submit an enquiry through this website, we collect the
          name, phone number, email address, and message you provide.
          Web analytics cookies (where used) may collect anonymous data
          about pages visited, time on site, and referring source.
        </p>

        <h2>How we use it</h2>
        <p>
          Enquiry details are used only to reply to your enquiry and
          provide the quote you have requested. We do not sell, rent,
          or share your contact details with third parties.
        </p>

        <h2>How long we keep it</h2>
        <p>
          Enquiry records are retained for as long as required to
          service the enquiry and meet any legal record-keeping
          obligations, then deleted on request.
        </p>

        <h2>Access and corrections</h2>
        <p>
          You can request access to, correction of, or deletion of
          your personal information held by SEQ Campers at any time.
          Email <a href="mailto:office@seqcampers.com.au">office@seqcampers.com.au</a>
          or call <a href="tel:0753002344">(07) 5300 2344</a>.
        </p>

        <h2>Complaints</h2>
        <p>
          If you believe we have mishandled your personal information,
          please contact us first so we can put it right. If you are
          not satisfied, you can lodge a complaint with the Office of
          the Australian Information Commissioner at
          <a href="https://www.oaic.gov.au">oaic.gov.au</a>.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Site>
